      <p>Our firm's energy and infrastructure department advises private, public and governmental bodies, both local and foreign in business of infrastructure establishment and maintenance and the exploitation of natural resources. The department represents companies that take part in executing and administrating national-level projects in the fields of natural gas, civil engineering projects of national importance and cutting edge projects in renewable energy, transportation, trains and water technology. The department advises local and foreign entrepreneurs, funders, service providers and technology suppliers working in the fields of energy and infrastructure. The department's work includes privatization trends, BOT projects, PPP transactions and financing transactions. The expansive experience accumulated by the department allows our firm to predict beforehand the challenges that await our clients in projects of these scales. Further, the department specializes in regulatory issues, attaining of licenses and permits, tenders, financing, construction and operation in all fields related to infrastructure, energy and natural resources.</p>
